\begin_inset Formula $E_{I}$
\end_inset
 contradict the paper itself: 
\begin_inset Formula $C$
\end_inset
 is ten times larger than stated, the cone is almost flat (
\begin_inset Formula $\theta_{B}/2\approx75^{\circ}$
\end_inset
