\begin_inset Formula $12.8\,\text{kV/cm}$
\end_inset
 instead of the required 
\begin_inset Formula $5\,\text{kV/cm}$
\end_inset
. The fit can only widen 
\begin_inset Formula $E_{I}$
\end_inset
 at the cost of breaking 
\begin_inset Formula $E_{sp}$
\end_inset
 and condition (a).
